27
00:01:17,260 --> 00:01:25,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">mayoinagarademo ii arukidashite</font></font></font></b></font>

28
00:01:17,260 --> 00:01:25,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">even if you get lost, let's start walking</font></font></font></b></font>

29
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">mou ikkai</font></font></font></b></font>

30
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">one more time</font></font></font></b></font>

31
00:01:41,490 --> 00:01:42,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

32
00:01:50,380 --> 00:01:54,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! Things will really be bad
if it stays like this...!</font>

33
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:58,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have to...</font>

34
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:05,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have to save...
everyone for sure!</font>

35
00:02:06,350 --> 00:02:12,320
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Light</font>

36
00:02:06,350 --> 00:02:12,320
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">and</font>

37
00:02:06,350 --> 00:02:12,320
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Darkness</font>

38
00:02:06,350 --> 00:02:12,320
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Name Gaara</font>

39
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:26,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you'll fight for the sake of others?!</font>

40
00:02:28,710 --> 00:02:31,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why you guys are
only at that level!</font>

41
00:02:31,460 --> 00:02:33,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't need a reason to fight!</font>

42
00:02:35,590 --> 00:02:39,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only the one who remains undefeated
can actually feel his own existence!</font>

43
00:02:39,970 --> 00:02:43,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on, forget about
your insignificant friends</font>

44
00:02:43,140 --> 00:02:45,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and fight only for the sake
of your own existence!</font>

45
00:02:46,470 --> 00:02:47,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Insignificant...</font>

46
00:02:49,390 --> 00:02:50,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">friends?</font>

47
00:02:53,270 --> 00:02:57,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who hold silly sentiments
about fighting</font>

48
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">should just die!</font>

49
00:02:58,780 --> 00:03:01,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sick of listening to you talk!</font>

50
00:03:02,030 --> 00:03:03,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll beat you up for sure!</font>

51
00:03:07,580 --> 00:03:10,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys misunderstand real strength!</font>

52
00:03:11,460 --> 00:03:12,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

53
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:07,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Why...? Why is it?!</font>

54
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:09,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why Yashamaru...?</font>

55
00:04:10,430 --> 00:04:12,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you, why...?</font>

56
00:04:16,060 --> 00:04:17,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?</font>

57
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:19,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Love is...</font>

58
00:04:19,730 --> 00:04:23,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a heart that desires to serve
a precious person who is close to oneself,</font>

59
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:25,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to love and watch over that person.</font>

60
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:27,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like my older sister did.</font>

61
00:04:30,950 --> 00:04:34,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are a precious person
who is close to me, Gaara-sama!</font>

62
00:04:37,080 --> 00:04:42,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Always...
only Yashamaru would always...</font>

63
00:04:42,630 --> 00:04:44,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me... always me...</font>

64
00:04:46,970 --> 00:04:48,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was an order.</font>

65
00:04:50,810 --> 00:04:54,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was commissioned to kill you...</font>

66
00:04:57,610 --> 00:04:59,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By your father...</font>

67
00:05:00,530 --> 00:05:01,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kazekage-sama.</font>

68
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My father...?</font>

69
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:17,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did my father...?</font>

70
00:05:17,580 --> 00:05:18,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...? Why me?</font>

71
00:05:20,590 --> 00:05:24,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara-sama, you who were born and possessed
by the Sand Spirit Shukaku...</font>

72
00:05:24,970 --> 00:05:28,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have been watched over
as an experiment.</font>

73
00:05:31,260 --> 00:05:35,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, Gaara-sama, you couldn't
control the living spirit Shukaku,</font>

74
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:39,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Sand Spirit which possesses
the power of the sand.</font>

75
00:05:40,110 --> 00:05:44,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eventually your existence would
become too dangerous for the village.</font>

76
00:05:46,860 --> 00:05:48,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before that occurred...</font>

77
00:05:51,370 --> 00:05:53,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Yashamaru, you had no choice...</font>

78
00:05:54,200 --> 00:05:56,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but to comply with my father's order...?</font>

79
00:05:57,790 --> 00:06:00,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... That is not correct.</font>

80
00:06:02,750 --> 00:06:05,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is true I accepted
Kazekage-sama's order.</font>

81
00:06:06,510 --> 00:06:10,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if I had wanted to turn it down,
I could have turned it down.</font>

82
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:14,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara-sama...</font>

83
00:06:15,890 --> 00:06:20,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Deep down in my heart,
I probably...</font>

84
00:06:21,900 --> 00:06:23,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">hated you.</font>

85
00:06:24,530 --> 00:06:27,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, whose birth took the life
of my beloved older sister.</font>

86
00:06:27,990 --> 00:06:30,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The child she left behind in death...</font>

87
00:06:30,990 --> 00:06:37,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thinking that you were her remembrance,
I tried desperately to love you.</font>

88
00:06:38,370 --> 00:06:40,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However... I was not able to.</font>

89
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:45,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My sister didn't choose to have you.</font>

90
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:48,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My sister became a sacrifice
for the village,</font>

91
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:51,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and she died while
cursing this village!</font>

92
00:06:53,010 --> 00:06:54,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From that time, I probably...</font>

93
00:06:55,100 --> 00:06:58,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have been burdened with a wound
of the heart that could never heal.</font>

94
00:06:59,850 --> 00:07:03,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlike a wound on the body,
there is no ointment and sometimes,</font>

95
00:07:03,230 --> 00:07:05,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it doesn't heal for one's entire life.</font>

96
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:08,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A wound of the heart?</font>

97
00:07:12,620 --> 00:07:16,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your name...
is the name my sister gave you.</font>

98
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:21,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"This child's name is Gaara...</font>

99
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:23,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"A devil that loves only itself...</font>

100
00:07:24,130 --> 00:07:25,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Love only yourself...</font>

101
00:07:26,880 --> 00:07:29,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"And fight only for
your own sake.</font>

102
00:07:31,010 --> 00:07:33,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"If you do that,
you will continue to exist."</font>

103
00:07:34,180 --> 00:07:36,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such was the hope it contained.</font>

104
00:07:36,890 --> 00:07:37,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

105
00:07:38,100 --> 00:07:40,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my sister did not give you this name</font>

106
00:07:40,390 --> 00:07:43,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because she was concerned
about you or loved you.</font>

107
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:47,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason she gave you this name,
a name so you would continue to exist...</font>

108
00:07:50,190 --> 00:07:52,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...was so that the deep-seated hatred
of my sister</font>

109
00:07:52,490 --> 00:07:55,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who died hating and cursing
this village...</font>

110
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:59,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would remain...</font>

111
00:08:01,910 --> 00:08:03,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and be known to all!</font>

112
00:08:20,390 --> 00:08:24,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were never... loved!</font>

113
00:08:33,740 --> 00:08:34,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the last...</font>

114
00:08:36,700 --> 00:08:37,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please die...</font>

115
00:09:07,690 --> 00:09:11,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe that my sister loved you, Gaara-sama.</font>

116
00:09:12,690 --> 00:09:13,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Love?</font>

117
00:09:20,660 --> 00:09:25,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The sand automatically trying to
protect you is like the love of a mother.</font>

118
00:09:26,290 --> 00:09:31,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe that sand is filled
with your mother's will.</font>

119
00:09:38,390 --> 00:09:39,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Love.</font>

120
00:10:26,390 --> 00:10:28,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Love only yourself.</font>

121
00:10:29,060 --> 00:10:32,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And fight only for your own sake.</font>

122
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:36,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that is Gaara...
That is me.</font>

123
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:38,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally understand.</font>

124
00:10:40,950 --> 00:10:42,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am alone.</font>

125
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:46,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will no longer believe in anyone...
or love anyone.</font>

126
00:10:48,040 --> 00:10:49,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am alone!</font>

127
00:10:54,590 --> 00:10:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, I am all by myself.</font>

128
00:11:13,980 --> 00:11:16,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?
Hurry up and come at me!</font>

129
00:11:16,980 --> 00:11:20,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you care what happens
to your so-called precious friends?!</font>

130
00:11:22,910 --> 00:11:23,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan!</font>

131
00:11:27,870 --> 00:11:28,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

132
00:11:30,160 --> 00:11:31,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto's not his usual self...</font>

133
00:11:32,790 --> 00:11:35,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did something happen between them?</font>

134
00:11:36,250 --> 00:11:37,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case...</font>

135
00:11:37,630 --> 00:11:40,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case,
I need to save Sakura-chan!</font>

136
00:11:41,130 --> 00:11:43,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... what to do?!</font>

137
00:11:45,550 --> 00:11:46,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it!</font>

138
00:11:47,220 --> 00:11:49,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since it's come to this...
Though it's gonna use up a lot of Chakra...</font>

139
00:11:51,770 --> 00:11:55,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no choice
but to summon the Chief Gamabunta!</font>

140
00:12:00,690 --> 00:12:02,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

141
00:12:11,160 --> 00:12:12,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?! You're a little kid!</font>

142
00:12:13,170 --> 00:12:15,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want something from me,
give me some snacks!</font>

143
00:12:15,670 --> 00:12:18,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't, I won't play with you!</font>

144
00:12:18,170 --> 00:12:21,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know something?
I hate you frogs!</font>

145
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:25,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?!
Don't make fun of amphibians! Really!</font>

146
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:29,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, I don't have time to
play with you, little squirt!</font>

147
00:12:32,270 --> 00:12:34,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! Why is it...?</font>

148
00:12:34,190 --> 00:12:37,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I practiced for so long, but with this,
there's no other way...</font>

149
00:12:38,690 --> 00:12:40,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I need to save everyone!</font>

150
00:12:42,110 --> 00:12:44,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone... you say?</font>

151
00:12:44,610 --> 00:12:45,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't make me laugh.</font>

152
00:12:46,410 --> 00:12:49,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I fight... only for myself!</font>

153
00:12:54,670 --> 00:12:57,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He... he's transforming again!</font>

154
00:13:01,010 --> 00:13:04,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't take me down,
the sand over this girl won't fall away!</font>

155
00:13:05,430 --> 00:13:08,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not only that, as time passes...</font>

156
00:13:08,640 --> 00:13:12,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this sand will slowly squeeze tighter
and eventually suffocate this girl!</font>

157
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:14,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan!</font>

158
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:17,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's getting closer and closer
to being a Perfect Possession.</font>

159
00:13:19,020 --> 00:13:21,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Jutsu hasn't been activated yet,</font>

160
00:13:21,610 --> 00:13:23,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but at this rate, I'll also be...!</font>

161
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:29,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those eyes...</font>

162
00:13:30,780 --> 00:13:32,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Shuriken!</font>

163
00:13:45,760 --> 00:13:47,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're... really weak!</font>

164
00:13:48,140 --> 00:13:49,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

165
00:13:49,470 --> 00:13:51,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what is that guy?</font>

166
00:14:09,160 --> 00:14:12,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're persistent...
Sarutobi-sensei!</font>

167
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:17,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It doesn't move?!</font>

168
00:14:19,580 --> 00:14:21,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You hard-to-kill fools!</font>

169
00:14:24,300 --> 00:14:27,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you still not understand, Orochimaru?</font>

170
00:14:28,930 --> 00:14:31,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf Village is my home!</font>

171
00:14:31,970 --> 00:14:35,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you I am the pillar
of that house!</font>

172
00:14:36,230 --> 00:14:41,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I'm saying
I will break that pillar!</font>

173
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:43,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as the people of the village</font>

174
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:47,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">fiercely fight to protect
their dear comrades,</font>

175
00:14:47,780 --> 00:14:51,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the pillar of the Leaf Village will not
be broken by the likes of you!</font>

176
00:14:51,990 --> 00:14:53,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder about that.</font>

177
00:14:55,290 --> 00:14:57,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do not underestimate the Hokage!</font>

178
00:15:00,620 --> 00:15:01,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-Impossible...!</font>

179
00:15:02,250 --> 00:15:06,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is...?
Most of your Chakra should be gone!</font>

180
00:15:06,920 --> 00:15:11,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chakra and Ninjutsu are
not all there is to strength!</font>

181
00:15:15,890 --> 00:15:18,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What lonely eyes...</font>

182
00:15:19,230 --> 00:15:21,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such lonely eyes...</font>

183
00:15:24,060 --> 00:15:28,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy is also turning into a monster...
the same as me.</font>

184
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:40,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hated every last one of them.</font>

185
00:15:41,170 --> 00:15:42,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't understand who I was,</font>

186
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:47,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">why I was so hated,
why I even existed.</font>

187
00:15:48,340 --> 00:15:49,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,</font>

188
00:15:50,130 --> 00:15:54,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're the Nine-Tailed Fox who killed
Iruka's parents and ruined the village!</font>

189
00:15:55,930 --> 00:15:59,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've been deceived by everyone
in the village all along!</font>

190
00:15:59,980 --> 00:16:01,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

191
00:16:01,390 --> 00:16:03,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I learned that the
Nine-Tailed Fox was inside me,</font>

192
00:16:04,350 --> 00:16:06,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">everyone in the village seemed
even more cold-hearted...</font>

193
00:16:07,820 --> 00:16:10,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was so deeply troubled...</font>

194
00:16:13,070 --> 00:16:13,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

195
00:16:16,660 --> 00:16:19,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Let's go have
ramen for a change!</font>

196
00:16:19,870 --> 00:16:22,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yay! I will, I will!</font>

197
00:16:22,330 --> 00:16:24,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have the one with
extra BBQ pork slices!</font>

198
00:16:25,040 --> 00:16:29,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh! Useless...
If you want to beat me train harder!</font>

199
00:16:29,210 --> 00:16:32,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up! I won't lose to you!</font>

200
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:36,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto!
What did Sasuke-kun say about me?</font>

201
00:16:36,550 --> 00:16:37,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He didn't say anything...</font>

202
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:42,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way! By the way!
Wouldn't you rather know how I feel...?</font>

203
00:16:42,270 --> 00:16:44,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Really, Sakura-chan!</font>

204
00:16:46,020 --> 00:16:47,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna eat now!</font>

205
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:53,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Um... Naruto, you'll really die if you eat
only noodles and sweet red bean porridge.</font>

206
00:16:53,530 --> 00:16:55,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a Ninja,
so eat more vegetables!</font>

207
00:16:56,200 --> 00:16:57,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here, have some!</font>

208
00:16:57,490 --> 00:17:00,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! I don't like vegetables!</font>

209
00:17:01,660 --> 00:17:04,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People appeared
who acknowledged me...</font>

210
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:06,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I became all right,</font>

211
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:09,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even though there was
the demon fox inside my body,</font>

212
00:17:09,460 --> 00:17:12,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">or even if the people of the village
looked at me with cold eyes.</font>

213
00:17:13,510 --> 00:17:16,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because...
I wasn't alone anymore!</font>

214
00:17:18,050 --> 00:17:21,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never imagined how happy and
fortunate I could feel.</font>

215
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:24,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How really... really...</font>

216
00:17:25,690 --> 00:17:27,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">great it was.</font>

217
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:29,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How truly great it was
to be here.</font>

218
00:17:29,610 --> 00:17:33,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was relieved to know
I am allowed to be here, to exist!</font>

219
00:17:35,780 --> 00:17:38,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why it scares me
to think about the past...</font>

220
00:17:38,990 --> 00:17:40,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That suffering is agonizing...</font>

221
00:17:42,290 --> 00:17:44,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a pitch-black hell!</font>

222
00:17:44,830 --> 00:17:47,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If... I had remained that way, all alone...</font>

223
00:17:50,290 --> 00:17:52,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's precisely why I understand!</font>

224
00:17:54,590 --> 00:17:58,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what did I have in this life,
why did I keep living?</font>

225
00:17:59,800 --> 00:18:01,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the answer I came to...</font>

226
00:18:02,060 --> 00:18:06,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am living in order to kill
human beings other than myself.</font>

227
00:18:08,190 --> 00:18:10,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what happened, but...</font>

228
00:18:11,060 --> 00:18:14,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy's always been
suffering all alone...</font>

229
00:18:14,940 --> 00:18:16,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even now, without ever feeling relief...</font>

230
00:18:17,030 --> 00:18:20,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only able to believe in himself...</font>

231
00:18:21,120 --> 00:18:23,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even now, he's battling in hell...</font>

232
00:18:24,450 --> 00:18:25,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's how it is...</font>

233
00:18:25,790 --> 00:18:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To him, someone like me
who's acknowledged by others...</font>

234
00:18:29,170 --> 00:18:33,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">might seem like a weakling in
a world of happiness without tension...</font>

235
00:18:35,210 --> 00:18:37,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can I really win against
a guy like this?</font>

236
00:18:40,970 --> 00:18:44,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?!
Are you afraid of me?</font>

237
00:18:44,510 --> 00:18:48,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To fight for the sake of oneself?
To fight for the sake of others?</font>

238
00:18:48,850 --> 00:18:53,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should just love yourself,
and fight for yourself!</font>

239
00:18:53,940 --> 00:18:57,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is the definition of
the strongest one!</font>

240
00:18:58,490 --> 00:19:00,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now fight me!</font>

241
00:19:00,360 --> 00:19:02,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened to
the boldness you had earlier?!</font>

242
00:19:02,870 --> 00:19:07,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Show me your strength!
I'll throw that strength to the ground!</font>

243
00:19:09,460 --> 00:19:14,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now what's the matter?!
If you don't fight me, I'll kill that girl!</font>

244
00:19:16,960 --> 00:19:18,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

245
00:19:21,590 --> 00:19:23,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

246
00:19:26,770 --> 00:19:27,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wind Style!</font>

247
00:19:29,980 --> 00:19:32,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Infinite Sandstorm Devastation!</font>

248
00:19:39,700 --> 00:19:42,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't good...
He really got me.</font>

249
00:19:42,860 --> 00:19:45,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, I'll toy with you
without killing you!</font>

250
00:19:45,870 --> 00:19:48,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I look forward to seeing
when and how you give up</font>

251
00:19:48,660 --> 00:19:50,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and abandon your friends!</font>

252
00:19:57,840 --> 00:19:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

253
00:20:00,420 --> 00:20:02,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... what is it?</font>

254
00:20:05,260 --> 00:20:06,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's far from over!</font>

255
00:20:18,190 --> 00:20:19,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Naruto...</font>

256
00:20:21,150 --> 00:20:23,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this... this feeling?</font>

257
00:20:24,780 --> 00:20:26,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Shuriken!</font>

258
00:20:32,790 --> 00:20:35,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Damn it!</font>

259
00:20:36,250 --> 00:20:37,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

260
00:20:38,300 --> 00:20:40,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-He's...</font>

261
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:45,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this?!
This feeling that's overcoming me?</font>

262
00:20:49,310 --> 00:20:50,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...!</font>

263
00:20:52,890 --> 00:20:55,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For some reason...
I don't want to lose to this guy...</font>

264
00:20:56,100 --> 00:20:57,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

265
00:21:01,230 --> 00:21:03,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...even if I die!</font>

266
00:21:05,080 --> 00:21:15,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

267
00:21:05,080 --> 00:21:15,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes it's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

268
00:21:15,870 --> 00:21:26,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

269
00:21:15,870 --> 00:21:26,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

270
00:21:37,150 --> 00:21:42,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou shizuka na kuuki suikomi hiroki sora ni kao age tobikomi</font></font></font></font>

271
00:21:37,150 --> 00:21:42,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, breathe in the air and lift your face to the sky and jump</font></font></font></font>

272
00:21:42,750 --> 00:21:47,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">toki ni ame ga futtara hito yasumi jaa yukusaki wa kaze fuku mama ni</font></font></font></font>

273
00:21:42,750 --> 00:21:47,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">if it rains, take a break go where the wind takes you</font></font></font></font>

274
00:21:47,950 --> 00:21:53,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">takusan no matotteru koukai kono kizu o muda ni shicha shounai</font></font></font></font>

275
00:21:47,950 --> 00:21:53,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">so many regrets don't let this scar be for naught</font></font></font></font>

276
00:21:53,160 --> 00:21:56,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">ude ni kunshou kizami ikoukai shougai</font></font></font></font>

277
00:21:53,160 --> 00:21:56,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">let's go carve the in our chest</font></font></font></font>

278
00:21:56,790 --> 00:21:58,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou kokkara ga SHOW TIME</font></font></font></font>

279
00:21:56,790 --> 00:21:58,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, it's show time, life begins now.</font></font></font></font>

280
00:21:58,300 --> 00:22:08,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

281
00:21:58,300 --> 00:22:08,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes It's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

282
00:22:08,770 --> 00:22:19,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

283
00:22:08,770 --> 00:22:19,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

284
00:22:19,320 --> 00:22:29,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kanashimi mo kaze ni kaete tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

